                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I can only recommend if you are coming back. As usual the dogfighting frigate Poseidon can be found in the hub station right after the tutorial. It has the best balance of offensive and defensive characteristics without sacrificing speed. It is also the only ship that has +100% damage modifier, albeit only limited to laser guns modules(which is the only weapon it can use). It has six high slots and maximum three offensive lasers, which makes the other three open to utility modules. For example, you can mount the remote armour repair module to repair stranded ships during travel to gain faction points on the side. You can also mount the energy vampire or neutraliser modules to further disallow enemy ships from doing certain actions. The Poseidon is a true jack of all trades and almost a master of all. The story can actually be progressed with just the Poseidon, it just needs to upgrade and swap out certain modules to suit the main quest.",
